{"type": "line", "artist": "Rob49", "song": "Add It Up", "line": "I’m in Trackhawk, I’m in Scat Pack, got hoes bunched up in Sprinters (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm in Trackhawk, I'm in Scat Pack, got hoes bunched up in Sprinters (Yeah)"], "meaning": "The Mercedes-Benz Sprinter is a luxury-class cargo van that comes in various body types for various types of work. In particular the “People Mover” model is arguably the most common variant, which turns the Sprinter into a minibus; with customizable seating for up to 15 passengers, these vans are highly popular amongst private transportation/tour companies.\n\n\n\nIn this lyric Rob is saying that while he may be driving around in his nicer vehicles (such as a Trackhawk or Scat Pack), he always has a Sprinter van full of women tailing him.", "annotation_id": "30585995", "url": "https://genius.com/30585995", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
